      "cat-harness:section": "tool.description",
      "prov:value": "It exists because the obvious composition mints a live 404: the declared path `uploads/` is relative to the INSTANCE and a forge URL needs it relative to the REPOSITORY, so pasting the declared path drops the `cat-harness/` segment. Owner, 2026-09-20, on the hand-written form: \"were it to exist, but it doesmt on main!!!!!\"",
